                                w::t = "As HVCS payments are made through the Reserve Bank's designated settlement system, ESAS, they cannot be reversed, repaid, recovered, or set aside under the terms of the Exchange Settlement Account terms and conditions and section 55 of the Financial Markets Infrastructure Act 2021."
